\section*{Verification note}

Each row was checked by direct substitution into
\begin{equation*}
y^{2}=(36n^{3}-19-12mn)^{2}-(2m)^{3}.
\end{equation*}

For every listed row, both signs \(y=|y|\) and \(y=-|y|\) give valid integer solutions because the equation only contains \(y^{2}\).

